{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cd5b3b1d8891c945b59c748a2f131ecb536d0b6c47af30159c25d407f89fbd5c", "ja": "（『屋根裏の道化師』の配役が決まり、各々、本番に\n向けて稽古に励んでいる。百合子は刑事役だけど……）", "zh": "（《阁楼里的小丑》的选角确定后，大家都各自为了\n正式演出做着练习。百合子负责演出刑警的角色……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "22ef3e9c2b2aff326b5869b4aebf3759d5b24bce24ed055ff8f66e09ed1d0962", "ja": "えー、ごほん。私が本件を……。\nうーん、もう少し強くかな？　えー……えーっ！", "zh": "呃──咳咳，我是负责本案件的……\n嗯──要再用力一点吗？呃──呃──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6ee59b6447a3a5d4655e8be0ebf380e37da1bb9b965e2865026e33351e772d05", "ja": "お疲れさま、百合子。\nって、もう衣装まで着ているのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，百合子。\n呃，你已经连服装都穿上了呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "2b8fdc03d993108c1a84e95873f5ed5b05e7b1447e5ba3ea375d6066eb7f8d66", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\n台本を読んでいたら、我慢できなくなっちゃって……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n我在读了剧本以后，就有些按捺不住……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "e3ac15156e7f6d067fa2e856defa3f55649539461f76c4c480c3679379050b01", "ja": "だって、映画ですよ映画！\nそれも刑事役だなんて……！", "zh": "因为这可是电影喔！\n而且竟然还能扮演刑警……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "2b7a593e535c5c6e7905818aef703a8c21259add23055ce25aef275518ebb257", "ja": "サスペンス映画における刑事役といえば、\nもう主役みたいなものじゃないですか！", "zh": "说到悬疑电影中的刑警角色，\n那不是主角等级的存在吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1006_p", "source_sha256": "10e858377a2ac623cc7716d18c627a2c6105d89f8c9ddf841618c7ff28201e43", "ja": "うん？　えっと……。\nまぁ、そうともいえる……のかな？", "zh": "嗯？呃……\n嗯，也能那么说……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "12e05b60f84a9f23da84f591def9ba2946ea9944f668c4dbc39e07b6189593c2", "ja": "そうですよ！　探偵が刑事と力を合わせ、\n難事件を解決する物語は世界中にありますし！", "zh": "就是那样没错！侦探和刑警同心协力\n解决困难事件的故事，全世界都有吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "e7f4090c735c43fa76dc2f330a18acc6a134d022f9caf418a254890330bd1b18", "ja": "安楽椅子探偵では、刑事が現場の情報を伝えたり！\nそれに、サスペンス物で刑事がいなかったら……。", "zh": "例如在安乐椅侦探类型的作品中，刑警会传达现场资讯\n给侦探！而且悬疑故事中，如果没有刑警在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "ac34b4f813225854bd446506492f1bb8b1751df43b7bb873583d987629d26085", "ja": "探偵を守る人がいなくなってしまうんですよ！？", "zh": "就没有人能保护侦探啰！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ce227f1e3a1af7261f30a12b67bfb6f610423083da76c62aff492581de9f6007", "ja": "まあ……。\n探偵を守る人は、大切かもしれないな。", "zh": "也是啦……\n保护侦探的角色或许挺重要的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "fb17b5d7143cada778e410297ef039730e9ff6886e53eaab3c4b3ef5db2e3ff8", "ja": "はい！　ですから脇役とはいえ、刑事は\nサスペンス物には無くてはならない重要な役で……。", "zh": "没错！所以虽然是配角，\n但刑警可是悬疑故事中不可或缺的重要角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "3d25fe63e1e193a546040ab4c7734b456159b441b37dc7252e6db3a60ec130c5", "ja": "はっ！　つまり今回の映画の結果次第では、\n私も注目を浴びるかもしれない、ということに……？", "zh": "啊！也就是说根据这部电影的票房，\n我也有可能受到瞩目吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f4a53d4d8151944c13b8fb188301e66e969640dd8972cf49ed518c146aaaf94d", "ja": "ああ、映画の規模もかなり大きいものだし、\nきっとたくさんのお客さんが注目するだろうな。", "zh": "是啊，这部电影的规模也相当大，\n我想一定会吸引到许多观众的注意吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "47d5a1ca5ea196a323d1317ca0601bf985dc99a3334136fe4a64b13a5de2ca68", "ja": "じゃあ、この映画が大ヒットしたら……\nもしかして、ハリウッドに呼ばれたりするかも！？", "zh": "那么，如果这部电影非常卖座的话……\n我搞不好会被好莱坞看中！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "a677a6b76ec629c953de5ac9ec161dfe242d58e142ab11907fb4c98bf4114928", "ja": "あ、あの！　{$P$}さん、\n私、今から英会話の勉強をした方がいいでしょうか？", "zh": "那、那个！{$P$}先生，\n我是不是该从现在开始学习英文会话呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1016_p", "source_sha256": "279a2c1d887dd15ff68d5f1893277e4800242b9c55f97368e50ba812348c144a", "ja": "将来のためにも英語の勉強はした方がいいと思うけど、\nハリウッドはさすがに気が早いんじゃないか？", "zh": "如果是为了将来着想，我认为是该学习英文，\n但是进军好莱坞未免有些太心急了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "d0d1ecbb212eee0926723e0b09f6e50b6a758857ad7a62a82ac1604183212dd7", "ja": "あっ……そうですよね。\nすみません、私、つい興奮しちゃって……。", "zh": "啊……说得也是呢。\n不好意思，我一不小心就太兴奋了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6458511740b6c9e6289f02009c225754212f4cec50095b64d638c84ef6fc4382", "ja": "でもそうだな、映画がヒットしたら……。\n百合子のその夢も、現実のものになるかもしれないぞ！", "zh": "不过你说得也对呢，要是电影卖座……\n你的那个梦想或许也会成真喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "9f3d07d0eb0640c8c2022cf6036a1290e4171eb6756992749abfeb2533fd59c1", "ja": "は、はい！　{$P$}さん、\n私、頑張ります！　そ、そうだ！　英語で返事を……！", "zh": "没、没错！{$P$}先生，\n我会加油的！对、对了！用英文来回答……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0173_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "0cb9585fc78809b4e95a785dd76df86c540d986d0d0abcd19675ee762f232953", "ja": "は、ハーイ、ハワユー？\nい、イエース、ファイン、センキュー！", "zh": "H ... hi, how are you?\nY ... yes, fine. Thank you!", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
